---
// VN30F1M, long at the open and out at the close, daily data since 2018 (51labs gambler's-ruin post):
// 777 up days and 734 down days = 1,511 days. A fair coin over 1,511 flips: mean 755.5, sd = sqrt(1511 x 0.25) = 19.44.
// Exact two-sided binomial p for 777 or 734: 0.280 (scipy). The bell curve is the normal approximation.
const N = 1511, MEAN = N / 2, SD = Math.sqrt(N * 0.25);
const X0 = 60, X1 = 860, K0 = MEAN - 3.2 * SD, K1 = MEAN + 3.2 * SD, YB = 290, YH = 190;
const kx = (k: number) => X0 + ((k - K0) / (K1 - K0)) * (X1 - X0);
const pdf = (k: number) => Math.exp(-0.5 * ((k - MEAN) / SD) ** 2);
const ky = (k: number) => YB - pdf(k) * YH;
function area(a: number, b: number) {
  let d = `M ${kx(a).toFixed(1)} ${YB}`;
  for (let i = 0; i <= 40; i++) { const k = a + ((b - a) * i) / 40; d += ` L ${kx(k).toFixed(1)} ${ky(k).toFixed(1)}`; }
  return d + ` L ${kx(b).toFixed(1)} ${YB} Z`;
}
let curve = '';
for (let i = 0; i <= 120; i++) { const k = K0 + ((K1 - K0) * i) / 120; curve += `${i ? 'L' : 'M'} ${kx(k).toFixed(1)} ${ky(k).toFixed(1)} `; }
const ticks = [700, 730, 755.5, 780, 810];
---
<figure class="apcd">
  <div class="apcd-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 380" role="img" aria-label="A bell curve of the number of up days a fair coin gives over 1,511 flips, centred on 755.5. The observed 777 up days sits just right of the centre. The two tails beyond 777 and 734 are shaded and together hold 28 percent of the probability.">
    <text x="20" y="28" class="apcd-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>51% up days is what a fair coin does</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>51% ngày tăng là chuyện đồng xu công bằng vẫn làm</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="50" class="apcd-sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Up days out of 1,511 flips of a fair coin</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Số ngày tăng trong 1.511 lần tung đồng xu công bằng</tspan>
    </text>
    <path d={area(K0, MEAN - 21.5)} class="apcd-tail" />
    <path d={area(MEAN + 21.5, K1)} class="apcd-tail" />
    <path d={curve} class="apcd-curve" />
    <line x1={X0} x2={X1} y1={YB} y2={YB} class="apcd-axis" />
    {ticks.map((k) => (
      <g>
        <line x1={kx(k)} x2={kx(k)} y1={YB} y2={YB + 5} class="apcd-axis" />
        <text x={kx(k)} y={YB + 22} text-anchor="middle" class="apcd-tick">{k === 755.5 ? '755.5' : k}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <line x1={kx(MEAN + 21.5)} x2={kx(MEAN + 21.5)} y1="70" y2={YB} class="apcd-obs" />
    <text x={kx(MEAN + 21.5) + 8} y="84" class="apcd-lab is-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>777 up days (51.4%)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>777 ngày tăng (51,4%)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={kx(MEAN + 21.5) + 8} y="102" class="apcd-sub2">
      <tspan data-lang-en>the strategy's record</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>kết quả của chiến lược</tspan>
    </text>
    <line x1={kx(MEAN - 21.5)} x2={kx(MEAN - 21.5)} y1="120" y2={YB} class="apcd-obs is-dash" />
    <text x={kx(MEAN - 21.5) - 8} y="134" text-anchor="end" class="apcd-lab">
      <tspan data-lang-en>734: the mirror image</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>734: phía đối xứng</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={kx(MEAN)} y="340" text-anchor="middle" class="apcd-num">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Shaded tails: a fair coin lands there 28% of the time (p = 0.28)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Phần tô: đồng xu công bằng rơi vào đó 28% số lần (p = 0,28)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={kx(MEAN)} y="362" text-anchor="middle" class="apcd-sub2">
      <tspan data-lang-en>z = (777 − 755.5) ÷ 19.4 = 1.11, well under the usual 1.96</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>z = (777 − 755,5) ÷ 19,4 = 1,11, thấp xa mức 1,96 thường dùng</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A 51labs post on gambler's ruin trades VN30F1M from the open to the close every day since 2018 and reports 777 up days and 734 down days. Taken as a coin-flip test, that record is ordinary.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Một bài của 51labs về gambler's ruin giao dịch VN30F1M từ giá mở cửa tới giá đóng cửa mỗi ngày từ 2018 và ghi 777 ngày tăng, 734 ngày giảm. Nhìn như một bài test tung đồng xu, kết quả đó rất bình thường.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .apcd { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .apcd-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .apcd svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .apcd text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .apcd .apcd-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .apcd .apcd-sub, .apcd .apcd-sub2 { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .apcd .apcd-tick { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .apcd .apcd-lab { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .apcd .apcd-lab.is-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .apcd .apcd-num { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .apcd-tail { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: none; }
  .apcd-curve { fill: none; stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .apcd-axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .apcd-obs { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .apcd-obs.is-dash { stroke-dasharray: 4 4; stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .apcd figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
